! PLANET~GETPLANETSTATS

Refreshes shared planet stats from the live game prompts.

''Include:'' [[planet.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/planet.ts:486`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
send &quot;cn&quot;
waiton &quot;(2) Animation display&quot;
getword CURRENTLINE $PLANET~ANSI_ONOFF 5
if ($PLANET~ANSI_ONOFF = &quot;On&quot;)
  send &quot;2qq&quot;
else
  send &quot;qq&quot;
</pre>

